    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d648">

                <pb facs="0768" n="682" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg682"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCreery to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2092.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the ambassador’s No. 2037, of
                    November 18 last, I have the honor to inclose copy and translation of a note
                    from Mr. Mariscal, and of the copy of the order of the President, therewith
                    transmitted, granting the extradition of Charles Kratz, accused of bribery in
                    Missouri.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fenton R.
                    McCreery.</hi></signed></closer>



